      "notes": "The cited Anderson gold EOS is known and Table IIa specifies Va=67.847 A^3. Applying the related catalog coefficients with that volume differs from the printed marker pressures by up to 0.318 GPa; exact numerical calibration provenance is unresolved. The related record is not an exact executable calibration link.",
